%N A399280 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} AH(4*k)/k^2, where AH(k) = A058313(k)/A058312(k) is the k-th alternating harmonic (or skew-harmonic) number.
%H A399280 Chunli Li and Wenchang Chu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/math12040589">Evaluating infinite series involving harmonic numbers by integration</a>, Mathematics, Vol. 12, No. 4 (2024), Article 589. See p. 10, eq. (26).
