%F A399280 Equals 45*zeta(3)/8 - 2*Pi*G, where G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%F A399280 Equals A399279 - A399220.
%e A399280 1.006388517056395551818366825458810597823339094309948...
%t A399280 RealDigits[45*Zeta[3]/8 - 2*Pi*Catalan, 10, 120][[1]]
